  "contentHtml": "<p>2단원 지구온난화 배우고, 학생들과 함께 할 여러 기후위기 활동을 생각하던 중 자원순환 업사이클링 수업을 해 보았습니다. 재활용 유리병이나 플라스틱병을 가져오게 하고 무드등을 만드는 활동입니다. 학생들이 크리스마스 분위기 난다고 좋아하네요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79484627fcf0270aa26efbb6fda7744478c3c0c4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79484627fcf0270aa26efbb6fda7744478c3c0c4\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a69169c0aa705deb836f2800bf86f74cadea773b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a69169c0aa705deb836f2800bf86f74cadea773b\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c7db87180abd8ae7e8d280833e3e61139a2d9f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c7db87180abd8ae7e8d280833e3e61139a2d9f5\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9692ab99be39d745c70e7f3f00786fd02e01c25\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9692ab99be39d745c70e7f3f00786fd02e01c25\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
